msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/advanced-techniques-for-qaoa/extracted-outputs/852dfeed-2871-4ca1-9754-15c95293198e-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![이전 코드 셀의 출력](/docs/images/tutorials/advanced-techniques-for-qaoa/extracted-outputs/852dfeed-2871-4ca1-9754-15c95293198e-0.avif)\n"

